    {"id":"interaction-rules","type":"text","x":48,"y":1701,"width":1180,"height":145,"text":"One marker for every trip day, including empty days. The selected marker follows scrolling.\nA preview shows the date, city and a few activities, or “Nothing planned yet”.\nFocus gives the same preview as hover. Enter activates the day. Escape dismisses the preview.\nMarkers have generous hit areas; long trips keep a scrollable date index rather than tiny targets.\nRespect reduced motion. Navigation does not discard a draft or bypass its leave warning.","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#647082","roughness":0},

