    {"id":"themes-copy","type":"text","x":1790,"y":1750,"width":710,"height":165,"text":"A is my starting recommendation for reading on the move.\nB keeps your reference's dark atmosphere, without heavy cards.\n\nUI type proposal: Source Sans 3, regular and semibold.\nSketch lettering here is not the final UI typeface.\nOne blue accent for navigation and actions. No decorative hero.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#647082"},
    {"id":"board-footer","type":"text","x":48,"y":2050,"width":2400,"height":60,"text":"Discuss on the canvas: A or B? Does the settings pane contain the right controls? Is the phone preview worth the extra tap?\nNot in this proposal: new backend features, automatic rescheduling, offline mode, bookings, expenses or a deployment.","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#647082","roughness":0}
